| 0 | M | M | M | M | M | M | M | M |
| 1 | M | M | M | M | M | M | M | M |
| 2 | M | M | M | M | M | M | M | M |
| 3 | M | M | M | M | M | M | M | M |

miss rate = 1（100%）

